   "locked": false,
   "text": "Accept \u2192 requester is notified \"Request accepted\"\nand gets a safety checklist. Reject \u2192 requester is\nnotified \"Not this time\". Filling the last seat\nauto-declines the rest (\"That one filled up fast\").",
